    "section": "<p>Activity 1</p>",
    "section_color": "#94EBFF",
    "section_duration": 360,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "Read the volumes specified on the Micropipetting Practice Card and use your micropipette to add the correct amount of liquid to each circle. \n\n\n1. Try to be precise so that the liquid stays in the circle. \n1. If you have trouble, dry the spot with a paper towel and try again.\n1. If you have trouble, try using both hands. Dr. Sjogren has shaky hands and uses her non-dominant hand to stabilize the micropipette being held in her dominant hand.\n \n",
    "data": null,
