    "section_color": "#94EBFF",
    "section_duration": 360,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "Try to pick up all of the liquid without leaving any behind. \n\n\n1. Set your micropipette to the same volume of liquid that is specified for each of your drops. \n1. Check to see if you can pick up all of the liquid without leaving any behind. There should be no space at the end of your pipette tip. \n \n",
