    "section_color": "#94EBFF",
    "section_duration": 360,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "In the blank space at the bottom of the card, pipette  5 \u00b5L   of water three times.\n\n\n1. How similar do the drops look in size? \n1. If they do not look exactly the same what could be some sources of error?\n \n\n",
